  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u38aa2118\" id=\"u38aa2118\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaeb4f77e\" id=\"uaeb4f77e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">原理图</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1425948e\" id=\"u1425948e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u97626cd9\" id=\"u97626cd9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">左车灯和右车灯的引脚分别是P07，P52</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf36832e3\" id=\"uf36832e3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9bd46841\" id=\"u9bd46841\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F25877396%2F1717550714907-670ab6f0-7b0a-472d-a608-ca62ce7f5cc1.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A467%2C%22originHeight%22%3A594%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fcfafa%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a3E7E%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ue470c182\" id=\"ue470c182\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1be986f7\" id=\"u1be986f7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u84af1d99\" id=\"u84af1d99\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">330欧的电阻作用以保证LED流过的电流不要超过LED最大工作电流</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue5fd9aab\" id=\"ue5fd9aab\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u40a50c2e\" id=\"u40a50c2e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">功能实现</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufc856e6e\" id=\"ufc856e6e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2a4e71fc\" id=\"u2a4e71fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">点亮左右车灯</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4a882af5\" id=\"u4a882af5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u444b8050\" id=\"u444b8050\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">几种GPIO模式</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufedf18b2\" id=\"ufedf18b2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u610c3b78\" id=\"u610c3b78\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">1</span><span data-lake-id=\"u09555df6\" id=\"u09555df6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">准双向口，也称为弱上拉模式，可做输入和输出操作，电流小，通常作为信号功能使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf2fba560\" id=\"uf2fba560\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u09858bca\" id=\"u09858bca\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">2</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub0cb695d\" id=\"ub0cb695d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">推挽输出，也称为强上拉模式，作为输出操作，电流持续，作为功率输出</span><span data-lake-id=\"u238f7fec\" id=\"u238f7fec\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u269c2bef\" id=\"u269c2bef\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">3</span><span data-lake-id=\"ubecf4570\" id=\"ubecf4570\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">开漏输出，可做输入和输出操作，需要外部提供上拉电阻</span><span data-lake-id=\"u55901385\" id=\"u55901385\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u5adc721a\" id=\"u5adc721a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">4</span><span data-lake-id=\"ude8860fe\" id=\"ude8860fe\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">高阻输入，电流无法输入，但是可以外部输入电平会拉高或拉低其位寄存器，用于数模转换</span><span data-lake-id=\"u795ed36d\" id=\"u795ed36d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2e28da5a\" id=\"u2e28da5a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">如何实现</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u03327d7a\" id=\"u03327d7a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"ueb46f42c\" id=\"ueb46f42c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">使用串口烧录工具进行引脚配置</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua203094c\" id=\"ua203094c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /><br /></span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub6c394e9\" id=\"ub6c394e9\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F25877396%2F1717550403148-731fc394-49f6-4bdf-9d0a-0e718fefa5bb.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fformat%252Cwebp%252Fresize%252Cw_937%252Climit_0%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A937%2C%22originHeight%22%3A651%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e3e0df%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fE5HB%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3689db5f\" id=\"u3689db5f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3db2b99d\" id=\"u3db2b99d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\"><br /></span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uccadce85\" id=\"uccadce85\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">点亮车灯代码</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4f32666c\" id=\"u4f32666c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: var(--yq-text-primary)\">​</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22led.c%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%5C%22STC8H.H%5C%22%5Cn%23define%20LED_LEFT_PIN%5Ct%5CtP07%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%E5%B7%A6%E7%81%AF%E5%BC%95%E8%84%9A%5Cn%23define%20LED_RIGHT_PIN%5Ct%5CtP52%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%E5%8F%B3%E7%81%AF%E5%BC%95%E8%84%9A%5Cn%5Cn%23define%20LED_LEFT_PIN_INIT()%5Ct%5Ct%7BP0M0%20%7C%3D%200x80%3B%20P0M1%20%26%3D%20~0x80%3B%7D%5Cn%23define%20LED_RIGHT_PIN_INIT()%5Ct%7BP5M0%20%7C%3D%200x04%3B%20P5M1%20%26%3D%20~0x04%3B%20%7D%5Cn%5Cn%23define%20LED_LEFT(s)%5Ct%5Ct%5CtLED_LEFT_PIN%20%3D%20s%5Ct%5Cn%23define%20LED_RIGHT(s)%5Ct%5CtLED_RIGHT_PIN%20%3D%20s%5Ct%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20Led_init()%20%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5CtLED_LEFT_PIN_INIT()%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5CtLED_RIGHT_PIN_INIT()%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnvoid%20Led_left_on()%20%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5CtLED_LEFT(1)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cnvoid%20Led_left_off()%20%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5CtLED_LEFT(0)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cnvoid%20Led_right_on()%20%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5CtLED_RIGHT(1)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cnvoid%20Led_right_off()%20%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5CtLED_RIGHT(0)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cnvoid%20main()%7B%5Cn%5Ct%20Led_init()%3B%5Cn%5Ctwhile(1)%7B%5Cn%5Ct%5CtLed_left_on()%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5CtLed_right_on()%3B%5Cn%5Ct%7D%5Cn%7D%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22led.c%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dpXiX%22%2C%22margin%22%